1
00:00:10,934 --> 00:00:15,600
The elephant and the raptor stared at the lion.

2
00:00:15,601 --> 00:00:19,961
"Sun Wukong is alive inside you," said the raptor.

3
00:00:19,962 --> 00:00:27,557
"Aren't you worried?"

4
00:00:27,558 --> 00:00:29,808
The lion sat down on his throne.

5
00:00:29,809 --> 00:00:32,085
"Worried about what?"

6
00:00:32,086 --> 00:00:34,479
"Well," said the raptor.

7
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:37,662
"The monkey is talking inside you.

8
00:00:37,663 --> 00:00:40,389
Doesn't that bother you?"

9
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:43,943
"Let him talk," said the lion defiantly.

10
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:46,847
"It doesn't bother me at all."

11
00:00:46,848 --> 00:00:50,032
"What shall I talk about?" Wukong called.

12
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:52,356
"Who wants to hear a story?"

13
00:00:52,357 --> 00:00:55,267
The elephant shook his head slowly.

14
00:00:55,268 --> 00:00:58,728
"What if the monkey never stops talking?

15
00:00:58,729 --> 00:01:01,930
You'll never get any sleep."

16
00:01:01,931 --> 00:01:06,624
"Hmm," said the lion. "That would be bad."

17
00:01:06,625 --> 00:01:09,005
He thought for a moment.

18
00:01:09,006 --> 00:01:10,367
"I know what to do.

19
00:01:10,368 --> 00:01:13,612
I'll stop eating."

20
00:01:13,613 --> 00:01:17,235
"What will that do?" asked the elephant.

21
00:01:17,236 --> 00:01:21,593
"Yes," said Wukong. "What will that do?"

22
00:01:21,594 --> 00:01:26,688
"If I don't eat, Wukong doesn't eat," said the lion.

23
00:01:26,689 --> 00:01:29,748
"I'll make him starve."

24
00:01:29,749 --> 00:01:32,812
Wukong laughed.

25
00:01:32,813 --> 00:01:34,361
"Nice try, lion!

26
00:01:34,362 --> 00:01:37,852
But I'll just turn one of my hairs into a stove.

27
00:01:37,853 --> 00:01:41,937
I'll cook a nice meal in here!"

28
00:01:41,938 --> 00:01:45,258
"Oh dear." The raptor shook his head.

29
00:01:45,259 --> 00:01:50,937
"If that monkey fires up a stove, it will make you very hot.

30
00:01:50,938 --> 00:01:53,805
Plus it will create lots of smoke.

31
00:01:53,806 --> 00:02:00,950
The smoke will fill your head, and you'll never stop sneezing!"

32
00:02:00,951 --> 00:02:04,564
At last the lion was starting to look nervous.

33
00:02:04,565 --> 00:02:07,920
"That would be terrible," he said.

34
00:02:07,921 --> 00:02:11,356
"I'd better cough out Wukong."

35
00:02:11,357 --> 00:02:13,902
The lion went to the middle of the room.

36
00:02:13,903 --> 00:02:19,915
He bent over and coughed. "Ahugh! Ahugh!"

37
00:02:19,916 --> 00:02:22,340
Wukong laughed.

38
00:02:22,341 --> 00:02:26,178
"I'm still in here!"

39
00:02:26,179 --> 00:02:31,064
"Ahugh! Ahugh!" The lion coughed again.

40
00:02:31,065 --> 00:02:35,597
But still Wukong stayed inside him.

41
00:02:35,598 --> 00:02:40,149
"I'm going to practice my fighting skills," announced the monkey.

42
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:43,466
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Boomph! Pow! Boomph! Pow!</i></font>

43
00:02:43,467 --> 00:02:47,251
Wukong punched and kicked inside the lion.

44
00:02:47,252 --> 00:02:49,584
The lion fell to his knees.

45
00:02:49,585 --> 00:02:55,075
"Ohh!" he moaned. "It hurts! It hurts!

46
00:02:55,076 --> 00:02:58,266
Wukong, please stop!"

47
00:02:58,267 --> 00:03:01,444
"Let's make a deal," said Wukong.

48
00:03:01,445 --> 00:03:05,897
"I'll come out if you promise to let us cross the mountain safely."

49
00:03:05,898 --> 00:03:09,060
The lion looked up at the raptor and the elephant.

50
00:03:09,061 --> 00:03:11,946
They both nodded.

51
00:03:11,947 --> 00:03:16,233
"We promise." The lion moaned again.

52
00:03:16,234 --> 00:03:18,598
"Okay then," said Wukong.

53
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:21,127
"I'm coming out."

54
00:03:21,128 --> 00:03:24,705
Wukong started the climb up the lion's throat.

55
00:03:24,706 --> 00:03:29,729
Just as he reached the lion's mouth, Wukong heard whispering.

56
00:03:29,730 --> 00:03:33,905
"Lion, I have a plan," whispered the elephant.

57
00:03:33,906 --> 00:03:38,179
"When Wukong tries to come out of your mouth, bite him."

58
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:40,941
"I don't know . . . ," whispered the lion.

59
00:03:40,942 --> 00:03:43,062
"Wukong is very strong.

60
00:03:43,063 --> 00:03:45,586
My belly still hurts."

61
00:03:45,587 --> 00:03:50,186
"Chomp him quickly, before he can fight back," whispered the elephant.

62
00:03:50,187 --> 00:03:53,579
"Okay," said the lion.

63
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:56,951
"Those dumb demons," thought Wukong.

64
00:03:56,952 --> 00:03:59,756
"Don't they realize I can hear them?"

65
00:03:59,757 --> 00:04:02,312
He pulled out his iron bar.

66
00:04:02,313 --> 00:04:05,840
"Shall I come out now?" asked the monkey.

67
00:04:05,841 --> 00:04:09,535
"Um, yes," said the lion.

68
00:04:09,536 --> 00:04:12,952
Wukong heard the three demons snickering.

69
00:04:12,953 --> 00:04:17,808
"Okay," said Wukong. "I'm coming out."

70
00:04:17,809 --> 00:04:21,843
He held out the iron bar.

71
00:04:21,844 --> 00:04:24,172
The lion bit down hard on the bar.

72
00:04:24,173 --> 00:04:30,161
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Crack!</i></font> A tooth shattered into tiny pieces.

73
00:04:30,162 --> 00:04:37,097
"Ow! Ow! Ow!" the lion howled in pain.

74
00:04:37,098 --> 00:04:39,593
Tears streamed down his face.

75
00:04:39,594 --> 00:04:44,667
He rolled around on the floor, holding his paws over his mouth.

76
00:04:44,668 --> 00:04:47,382
"You villains!" Wukong shouted.

77
00:04:47,383 --> 00:04:50,020
"I heard you whispering!"

78
00:04:50,021 --> 00:04:54,167
"I'm sorry." The lion was still crying.

79
00:04:54,168 --> 00:04:56,931
"I won't try to bite you again.

80
00:04:56,932 --> 00:05:01,258
Please don't hurt me anymore."

81
00:05:01,259 --> 00:05:03,182
Wukong hesitated.

82
00:05:03,183 --> 00:05:05,318
"I'm coming out now.

83
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:09,120
You'd better not try any more tricks!"

84
00:05:09,121 --> 00:05:11,733
"We won't," said the elephant.

85
00:05:11,734 --> 00:05:15,170
"We promise," said the raptor.

86
00:05:15,171 --> 00:05:20,043
Wukong popped out of the lion's nose.

87
00:05:20,044 --> 00:05:28,429
He glared at the demons for a moment and then walked out of the cave.

88
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:35,346
As soon as the monkey was gone, the elephant turned to the other two demons.

89
00:05:35,347 --> 00:05:42,684
"I have a new plan for capturing the Tang Monk."

